<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1619) <span class="when">Oct 15, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Recall a conform.</b> Every pull saves its conform (the cut, media and camera folders, Edit Ref, joins, names and the cut&#8217;s Pull Plates settings) in the sequence&#8217;s folder, hidden and dated. Media &#9656; Recall Conform&#8230; picks the job (your Kitsu projects) and the sequence and opens the newest; the older ones are listed. Media &#9656; Save Conform to Sequence saves one without pulling.</li>
<li><b>Review movies in the day&#8217;s folder.</b> A plate&#8217;s review movie goes in <code>01_REFERENCE/dailies/&lt;date&gt;/</code> (Los Angeles date), where <code>vfx edit commit</code> and <code>vfx dailies</code> put theirs. Rename and Merge find movies there too.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
